                                "sense_id": "e705141d-2548-35e7-ab2d-0cd206251993",
                                "text": "A large shield, in the centre whereof was depicted / A hand lately severed, - the artist, addicted / ('Twas De Rodon bimself) to pre-Raphaelite rules, / Had made the wrist \"sanglant\" with drops from it \"gules.\""
